# 47 of 406 tracked text files were stored with CRLF and the rest with LF, from
# a mix of editors on Windows. Editing a CRLF file with an LF-writing tool turns
# a 13-line change into a whole-file rewrite, which buries the real change in a
# review. Normalize in the repository; check out whatever the platform wants.
* text=auto eol=lf

# binary: never touch
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.aif binary
*.aiff binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.sf2 binary
*.db  binary
